<title>JAPAN: Chubu Elec to issue 150 bln yen convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Chubu Elec to issue 150 bln yen convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubu Electric Power Co Inc said on Wednesday that it had decided to issue 150 billion yen worth of convertible bonds.  </p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sakura Bank</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   2	  AMT   150 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 1.0 tentatively ISSU PRICE	  MATURITY 31.Mar.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 30.Mar.06</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 11.Oct.96  INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 03-09 Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR BBB+	  LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on Oct 2.</p>
</text>
